        "openmrs_entity_id": "hiv_positive_women_support_group_note",
        "type": "toaster_notes",
        "text": "As you visit the health facility there are some support groups for HIV+ mothers who can help you/guide you on how you can take care of your self during pregnancy and after delivery so that you can give birth safely and to a healthy HIV free baby. Please ask the medical worker in order to connect you and give you more information on this. These are HIV positive women who managed to follow and complete PMTCT care cascade and they gave birth to a healthy and free HIV baby, they will help you throughout your journey so that you can give birth to an HIV free baby.",
